<div id="pf13" class="pf w0 h0" data-page-no="13"><div class="pc pc13 w0 h0"><img class="bi x3 y1f0 w3 h2a" alt="" src="bg13.png"/><div class="t m0 x3 he y30 ff9 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff2">第<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">5<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>章<span class="_ _12"> </span>网络层<span class="_ _55"> </span><span class="ff3">5.2<span class="_ _12"> </span>ICMP</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y18d ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">5.1.4<span class="_ _32"> </span><span class="ff1">不可用于主机的特殊地址</span></div><div class="t m0 x1d h6 y18e ff3 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">1.<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff1 fc0">回环地址<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(Loopback<span class="_ _0"> </span>A<span class="_ _29"></span>ddress)</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y18f ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">范围<span class="ff4">：<span class="ff10">127.x.x.x<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(</span></span>通常是<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff10">127.0.0.1<span class="ff3">)</span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y190 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">作用<span class="ff4">：用于本机进程间通信测试。发送到该地址的数据包不会离开网卡，直接返回本机。</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y1f1 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">注意<span class="ff4">：虽然<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">127<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>属于<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">A<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>类地址的范围，但它</span>不指代任何网络<span class="ff4">。</span></div><div class="t m0 x1d h6 y1f2 ff3 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">2.<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff1 fc0">网络地址<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(Netw<span class="_ _29"></span>ork<span class="_ _0"> </span>A<span class="_ _29"></span>ddress)</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y1f3 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">特征<span class="ff4">：主机号<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(HostID)<span class="_ _0"> </span></span></span>全为<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">0<span class="ff4">。</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y1f4 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">作用<span class="ff4">：表示该网络本身（例如<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff10">192.168.1.0</span>）<span class="_ _2"></span>。</span></div><div class="t m0 x1d h6 y1f5 ff3 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">3.<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff1 fc0">广播地址<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(Broadcast<span class="_ _0"> </span>A<span class="_ _29"></span>ddress)</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y1f6 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">特征<span class="ff4">：主机号<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(HostID)<span class="_ _0"> </span></span></span>全为<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">1<span class="ff4">。</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y1f7 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">作用<span class="ff4">：用于向本网络内的所有主机发送广播（例如<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff10">192.168.1.255</span>）<span class="_ _2"></span>。</span></div><div class="t m0 x1d h6 y1f8 ff3 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">4.<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff1 fc0">本网络本主机</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y1f9 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">特征<span class="ff4">：<span class="ff3">32<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>位全为<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">0<span class="_ _0"> </span>(<span class="ff10">0.0.0.0</span>)</span>。</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y1fa ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">作用<span class="ff4">：通常在系统启动时使用（<span class="ff3">DHCP<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>请求）<span class="_ _2"></span>，表示“本机”<span class="_ _2"></span>。</span></div><div class="t m0 x1d h6 y1fb ff3 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">5.<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff1 fc0">受限广播地址</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y1fc ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">特征<span class="ff4">：<span class="ff3">32<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>位全为<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">1<span class="_ _0"> </span>(<span class="ff10">255.255.255.255</span>)</span>。</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y1fd ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">作用<span class="ff4">：对本网络上的所有主机进行广播（路由器不转发）<span class="_ _2"></span>。</span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h13 y1fe ff9 fs4 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _5"> </span><span class="ff6">5.2<span class="_ _24"> </span>ICMP</span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y1ff ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">5.2.1<span class="_ _32"> </span><span class="ff1">基本概念</span></div><div class="t m0 x26 h7 y200 ff3 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">ICMP<span class="ff4">（网际控制报文协议）用于在<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>IP<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">主机、路由器之间传递控制消息。</span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y201 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">封装方式<span class="ff4">：<span class="ff3">ICMP<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>报文是装在<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">IP<span class="_ _0"> </span></span></span>数据报<span class="ff4">的数据部分中发送的。</span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y202 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">作用<span class="ff4">：虽然<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">ICMP </span>是<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">IP </span>层的协议，但它主要用于是为了提高<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ff3">IP </span>数据交付成功的机会，允许主机或路由器</span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h7 y203 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">报告差错情况和提供有关异常情况的报告。</div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y204 ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">5.2.2<span class="_ _32"> </span>ICMP<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ff1">报文的分类</span></div><div class="t m0 x26 h6 y205 ff3 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">ICMP<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">报文主要分为两大类：<span class="ff1">差错报告报文</span>和<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff1">提供信息的询问报文</span>。</span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y206 ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">5.2.2.1<span class="_ _32"> </span><span class="ff1">差错报告报文<span class="_ _28"> </span></span>(Error<span class="_ _28"> </span>Reporting<span class="_ _28"> </span>Messag<span class="_ _3"></span>es)</div><div class="t m0 x26 h7 y207 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">用于向源主机报告数据包在传输过程中遇到的错误。</div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y208 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">目的不可达报文<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(Destination<span class="_ _0"> </span>Unr<span class="_ _3"></span>eachable)<span class="ff4">：当路由器或主机无法交付数据报时，向源点发送该报文。</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y209 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">超时报文<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(Time<span class="_ _0"> </span>Ex<span class="_ _29"></span>ceeded)<span class="ff4">：</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h7 y20a ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">当路由器收到<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">TTL<span class="_ _0"> </span>(</span>生存时间<span class="ff3">)<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>为<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">0<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>的数据报时（<span class="ff11">T<span class="_ _4"></span>racer<span class="_ _29"></span>oute<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff2">原理<span class="ff4">）<span class="_ _2"></span>。</span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h7 y20b ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">当终点在预先规定的时间内不能收到一个数据报的全部数据片时。</div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y20c ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">源抑制报文<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(Sour<span class="_ _29"></span>ce<span class="_ _0"> </span>Quench)<span class="ff4">：<span class="_ _1"></span>当路由器或主机拥塞丢弃数据报时，<span class="_ _27"></span>向源点发送该报文，<span class="_ _1"></span>让源点把发送速率</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h7 y20d ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">放慢。<span class="_ _2"></span>（注：现代网络中已很少使用）<span class="_ _2"></span>。</div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y20e ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">参数问题报文<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(Parame<span class="_ _3"></span>ter<span class="_ _0"> </span>Problem)<span class="ff4">：当路由器或目的主机收到的数据报的首部中有的字段的值不正确时。</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y20f ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">改变路由<span class="_ _f"></span>报文<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(Redirect)<span class="ff4">：路由器把<span class="_ _f"></span>改变路由报文<span class="_ _f"></span>发送给主机，让<span class="_ _f"></span>主机知道下<span class="_ _f"></span>次应将数据报<span class="_ _f"></span>发送给另外的</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h7 y210 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">路由器（重定向）<span class="_ _2"></span>。</div><div class="t m0 x3 he y5f ff9 fs1 fc8 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _44"> </span><span class="fc7"><span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">第<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3 fc0">14<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>页<span class="_ _0"> </span></span><span class="_ _44"> </span><span class="fc9"></span></span></div></div><div class="pi" data-data='{"ctm":[1.000000,0.000000,0.000000,1.000000,0.000000,0.000000]}'></div></div>
